#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/libdrm.xml:84
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<xref linkend=\"cairo\"/> (for tests), <xref linkend=\"cmake\"/> (could be "
"used to find dependencies without pkgconfig files), <xref "
"linkend=\"DocBook\"/>, <xref linkend=\"docbook-xsl\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"docutils\"/>, and <xref linkend=\"libxslt\"/> (to build manual "
"pages), <xref linkend=\"libatomic_ops\"/> (required by architectures without"
" native atomic operations), <xref linkend=\"valgrind\"/>, and <ulink "
"url=\"https://cunit.sourceforge.net/\">CUnit</ulink> (for AMDGPU tests)"
msgstr ""
"<xref linkend=\"cairo\"/> (para testes), <xref linkend=\"cmake\"/> (poderia "
"ser usado para encontrar dependências sem arquivos do "
"&quot;pkgconfig&quot;), <xref linkend=\"DocBook\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"docbook-xsl\"/>, <xref linkend=\"docutils\"/> e <xref "
"linkend=\"libxslt\"/> (para construir páginas de manual), <xref "
"linkend=\"libatomic_ops\"/> (exigido por arquiteturas sem operações atômicas"
" nativas), <xref linkend=\"valgrind\"/> e <ulink "
"url=\"https://cunit.sourceforge.net/\">CUnit</ulink> (para testes de "
"&quot;AMDGPU&quot;)"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/libdrm.xml:98
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Libdrm"
msgstr "Instalação do Libdrm"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/libdrm.xml:109
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>libdrm</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o &quot;<application>libdrm</application>&quot; executando os "
"seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/libdrm.xml:113
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=$XORG_PREFIX \\\n"
"            --buildtype=release   \\\n"
"            -Dudev=true           \\\n"
"            -Dvalgrind=disabled   \\\n"
"            ..                    &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=$XORG_PREFIX \\\n"
"            --buildtype=release   \\\n"
"            -Dudev=true           \\\n"
"            -Dvalgrind=disabled   \\\n"
"            ..                    &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. One test,
#.       'threaded' in the nouveau subdirectory, is known to fail with a
#.       30 second timeout.
#.  Regarding the 'threaded' test, it's now skipped by default (2.4.102)
#.            -renodr
#.  Tests may hang
#.       for unknown reasons.
#.  If nouveau threaded test hangs, you can disable it
#.       with
#.       <command>
#. sed -i 's/^TESTS/#&amp;/' tests/nouveau/Makefile.in</command>.
#.       Now that tests are run with ninja, the test merely times out after 30
#. seconds.
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/libdrm.xml:124
#, xml-text
msgid "To check the results, issue <command>ninja test</command>."
msgstr ""
"Para verificar os resultados, execute &quot;<command>ninja "
"test</command>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/libdrm.xml:140
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/libdrm.xml:143
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/libdrm.xml:148
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/libdrm.xml:154
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-Dudev=true</parameter>: This parameter enables support for using"
" <application>Udev</application> instead of <command>mknod</command>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-Dudev=true</parameter>: Esse parâmetro habilita o suporte para "
"usar o &quot;<application>Udev</application>&quot; em vez do "
"&quot;<command>mknod</command>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/libdrm.xml:159
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-Dvalgrind=disabled</parameter>: This parameter disables building"
" libdrm with valgrind support. This fixes building some packages that use "
"libdrm. Change this parameter to \"enabled\" (or remove it) if you need "
"support for valgrind."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-Dvalgrind=disabled</parameter>: Esse parâmetro desabilita "
"construir libdrm com suporte a valgrind. Isso corrige construir alguns "
"pacotes que usam libdrm. Mude esse parâmetro para \"enabled\" (ou remova-o) "
"se você precisar de suporte para valgrind."

